string "talk.mole" "Old Burrow"
string "talk.1" "Well now, a bell-keeper, this deep? Mind the beetles: they bite."
string "talk.2" "The gloam dragged a chime into its hall below. Big as a barrel, that one."
string "talk.3" "I trade in what the hill gives up. Glimmers for goods, as ever."
string "talk.4" "Then let us trade."
